{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8fae19c1a8cc454b093b4cd7dad5c8b3.webp?t=1758704319\" width=784 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dense forests, panic-stricken cities, damp caves, and grim catacombs\u2014you must track down every clue and unravel a string of grisly murders. Discover the Kingdom through Sir Arthur, a great knight of the fire element, renowned across the world for his feats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/5723754ced4347b14948d8a06366d461.webp?t=1758704319\" width=776 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/230c21ad28df7e8133b860c5cc25f801.poster.avif?t=1758704319\" width=382 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/230c21ad28df7e8133b860c5cc25f801.webm?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/230c21ad28df7e8133b860c5cc25f801.mp4?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8fb0699a2cb076c94d044b8f543c4dfa.poster.avif?t=1758704319\" width=382 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8fb0699a2cb076c94d044b8f543c4dfa.webm?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8fb0699a2cb076c94d044b8f543c4dfa.mp4?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/5723754ced4347b14948d8a06366d461.webp?t=1758704319\" width=776 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit Fusion is a 2D adventure set in a fantasy kingdom filled with mysteries, hidden paths, and wondrous locations. Talk to old comrades, battle hideous monsters, explore every corner of the Kingdom\u2014and stop the killer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8ce6550da2dded8f04ed3bf09c0ac345.poster.avif?t=1758704319\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8ce6550da2dded8f04ed3bf09c0ac345.webm?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8ce6550da2dded8f04ed3bf09c0ac345.mp4?t=1758704319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/0241869d32b1faea12f1919837cf6130.webp?t=1758704319\" width=776 height=18 /></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic metroidvania with vibrant characters and a rich, intriguing story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield the elements! Find the soul relics of your brothers-in-arms and combine elements however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive controls let you feel Arthur\u2019s combat skills and truly experience what it means to be a legendary fire knight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Kingdom! Find items, trade, and equip your hero to make this adventure unforgettable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face never-before-seen monsters. The Kingdom is a land of both fairytales and nightmares. Stop the latter to protect the world\u2019s dreams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/3f45d74689eb9fac28b586331a87b0ff.avif?t=1758704319\" width=776 height=97 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988470?t=1758704319","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988470?t=1758704319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/86454c3ab58ee2b5637ffa3480cbbab65eef827d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758704319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/86454c3ab58ee2b5637ffa3480cbbab65eef827d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758704319","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988470/extras/8fae19c1a8cc454b093b4cd7dad5c8b3.webp?t=1758704319\" width=784 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dense forests, panic-stricken cities, damp caves, and grim catacombs\u2014you must track down every clue and unravel a string of grisly murders. Discover the Kingdom through Sir Arthur, a great knight of the fire element, renowned across the world for his feats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/398